# REQ-REPO-004 post-merge verification (master 2304f231f7ef5fc271880d699b59246b39567a7d, 2026-09-29)

[merge incident]
git merge --no-ff recorded the change as rename connect.config -> connect.config.template (100%).
Rename application deleted Client/connect.config from disk during the merge (A2 transiently violated),
despite correct step-by-step execution on the branch. This is the second manifestation of the
rename-detection trap documented in the requirement (first: command-joining on branch 1).

[recovery -- requirement §九 prescribed path, backup from step 1]
